[09:59] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'as I mentioned before, I wanted this car to handle much much better than it did originally. &gt;&gt; So, it\'s a weight &gt;&gt; Or or to put it another way, I wanted it to handle as good as I thought it should handle when I first drove it drove it'

[10:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'when it was petrol. Um so, I wanted all the rear weight in front of the rear axle uh or the rear drive shafts, if you like. And I wanted all the front weight behind the front or really low down. So, what we\'ve done is we flipped over the'

[10:27] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'motor this way to get the weight further forward. This is your main battery pack. Um bear in mind when this was petrol, this whole area here, right the way to the edge here, it was fully &gt;&gt; Yeah. &gt;&gt; Yeah. It was full. You had engine, flat'

[10:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
